  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><color=#FFC93C><size=110%>GOAL</size></color></b>

    Peggy always runs forward, like in Snake. Eat burgers to grow longer, and don''t run into your own body.


    <b><color=#FFC93C><size=110%>CONTROLS</size></color></b>

    Steer<pos=45%><b>A / D</b>  or  <b>Left / Right</b>

    Boost<pos=45%><b>W</b>  or  <b>Up</b>  or  <b>Shift</b>

    Handbrake (sharp turns)<pos=45%><b>S</b>  or  <b>Down</b>

    Jump<pos=45%><b>Space</b>

    Gamepad<pos=45%>Stick to steer, <b>RT</b> boost, <b>LT</b> handbrake, <b>A</b> jump


    <b><color=#FFC93C><size=110%>ABILITIES</size></color></b>

    Handbrake and boost only work while Peggy has her legs. Lose them and you''ll have to run back and grab them.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
